#   STAGE 3  Find the metadata table holding the GCS URI, and join it
#   STAGE 4  Manual tests -- paste a gs:// path or URL you've been given
#   STAGE 5  Pilot: push a sample of attachments through the full
#            chain (locate -> download -> is it a PDF -> extract text)
#   STAGE 6  Summary + export
